### BennyCar Vehicle Service - Test Data Creation
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api/v1

### ============================================================================
### STEP 1: Create Brands
### ============================================================================

### Create BMW Brand
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "BMW",
  "description": "Bayerische Motoren Werke AG - Premium German automobile manufacturer known for performance and luxury",
  "logoUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/BMW.svg/200px-BMW.svg.png",
  "countryOfOrigin": "Germany",
  "foundedYear": 1916
}

### Create Mercedes-Benz Brand
POST {{baseUrl}}/brands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "description": "Daimler AG brand - German luxury automotive manufacturer producing premium vehicles",
  "logoUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Mercedes-Logo.svg/200px-Mercedes-Logo.svg.png",
  "countryOfOrigin": "Germany",
  "foundedYear": 1926
}

