### ============================================================================
### STEP 2: Get All Brands (to retrieve IDs)
### ============================================================================

### Get all brands
GET {{baseUrl}}/brands

### ============================================================================
### STEP 3: Create Vehicle Types
### ============================================================================

### Create Sedan Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicle-types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sedan",
  "description": "Four-door passenger car with separate trunk, ideal for families and business",
  "iconUrl": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3097/3097153.png"
}

